    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salarybot Shuffle is an arcade action platformer that attempts to\u00a0simulate the feeling of a full-time job collecting recalled products. Take control of an incredibly powerful Salarybot as you try to meet your quotas as a remote employee for the Technology Weapons &amp; Technology Company.<br><br>While the Salarybots have almost infinite durability, you don't have infinite time. You'll need to use your time wisely to ensure it's still worth it for the company to keep you deployed. Explore different ships with randomized items, enemies, and rewards each run.<br><br>Dash, strike, jump, launch, juggle, wall slide, and parry your way through a number of different enemies and challenges designed to test your ability to move quickly and think on your robot feet.<br><br>Compete for employee of the month with up to 3 additional friends online with rollback netcode.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salarybot Shuffle is an arcade action platformer that attempts to\u00a0simulate the feeling of a full-time job collecting recalled products. Take control of an incredibly powerful Salarybot as you try to meet your quotas as a remote employee for the Technology Weapons &amp; Technology Company.<br><br>While the Salarybots have almost infinite durability, you don't have infinite time. You'll need to use your time wisely to ensure it's still worth it for the company to keep you deployed. Explore different ships with randomized items, enemies, and rewards each run.<br><br>Dash, strike, jump, launch, juggle, wall slide, and parry your way through a number of different enemies and challenges designed to test your ability to move quickly and think on your robot feet.<br><br>Compete for employee of the month with up to 3 additional friends online with rollback netcode.</p>",
    "short_description": "Salarybot Shuffle is a arcade action platformer that attempts to really simulate the feeling of a full time job collecting recalled products. Dash, strike, jump, launch, juggle, wall slide, and parry your way through enemies and challenges quickly enough to meet your ever elusive company quota.",
